      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cannon_Falls%2C_Minnesota",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Fireman's Hall, an 1888 Italianate limestone building, now houses the local Historical Society and once served as the public library.",
